Hermes Binance USDT-M selection workbench
========================================

This product uses TradingView Lightweight Charts
(https://github.com/tradingview/lightweight-charts), licensed under Apache-2.0.

TradingView Lightweight Charts requires a visible attribution on every page
that renders a chart, including a link to https://www.tradingview.com.
See apps/web footer and https://github.com/tradingview/lightweight-charts/blob/master/README.md.

KLineChart (https://github.com/klinecharts/KLineChart) is Apache-2.0.
dockview (https://github.com/mathuo/dockview) is MIT — this product uses the
community package only, never dockview-enterprise.

Cryptofeed (optional later realtime path) requires attribution to Bryant Moscon.

CoinGecko market-cap / circulating-supply data: display "Powered by CoinGecko"
when those fields are shown.

Binance market data is used under Binance API Terms. Do not resell the live feed.
